### 1. Ambil semua data studio
GET http://localhost:3000/api/studio

### 2. Ambil studio berdasarkan ID
GET http://localhost:3000/api/studio/1

### 3. Tambah studio baru
POST http://localhost:3000/api/studio
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Studio C - Green Screen",
  "description": "Studio khusus produksi video dan visual effect dengan pencahayaan profesional.",
  "capacity": 10,
  "price_per_hour": 250000,
  "image_url": "studio-c.jpg"
}

### 4. Merubah data studio
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/studio/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Studio A - Minimalist Premium",
  "price_per_hour": 175000,
  "status": "active"
}

### 5. Menghapus data studio
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/studio/3

### 6. Buat Booking Baru (Klien)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/booking
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studio_id": 1,
  "customer_name": "Julham Septian",
  "customer_email": "julham@gmail.com",
  "customer_phone": "081234567890",
  "booking_date": "2026-06-10",
  "start_time": "10:00",
  "end_time": "12:00"
}

### 7. Lacak Status Pesanan Berdasarkan Kode Resi (Ganti STO-xxxxxx sesuai hasil response di atas)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/booking/track/STO-745299

### 8. Ambil Semua Daftar Booking (Admin)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/booking

### 9. Verifikasi / Ubah Status Pembayaran oleh Admin (Ubah ID & status jadi confirmed)
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/booking/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "payment_status": "confirmed"
}